      "alt": "TQMa7x board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX7 with integrated Cortex M4 and Smart Card Interface.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa7x is a security-oriented Dual Cortex®-A7 module based on i.MX7, featuring an integrated Cortex M4 and Smart Card Interface. It offers graphics support with full HD capabilities and low power consumption (typ. 2 W), making it an efficient solution. The module also provides IEEE 1588 hardware support and high-speed communication through 2x Gigabit Ethernet and 1x PCIe interface, ensuring fast and secure data processing. This versatile module is suitable for applications in networking, industrial automation, and controls.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:16:23 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
