     "table": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td><b>CPU</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Cortex®-A7 - Up to 1GHz</li>\n<li>i.Mx7S Single Core</li>\n<li>i.Mx7D Dual Core</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Memory</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Quad SPI NOR - Up to 256 MB</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>EEPROM - 0/64-kbit</li>\n<li>eMMC - Up to 32 GB</li>\n<li>DDR3L - Up to 2 GB</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Graphics</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>LCD Interface (24-bit RGB)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Communications Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>CAN - Up to 2x CAN 2.0 B</li>\n<li>USB - Up to 2x USB 2.0 high-speed OTG, 1x USB 2.0 high-speed HOST interface</li>\n<li>Ethernet - Up to 2x Ethernet 10/100/1000 Mbit</li>\n<li>Serial Ports - Up to 7x UART</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>I2S - Up to 3x I²S</li>\n<li>I2C - Up to 4x I²C</li>\n<li>SPI - Up to 4x SPI</li>\n<li>SD Card - 1x SD-Card, Up to 3x SDIO/MMC</li>\n<li>PCIe - Up to 1x PCIe</li>\n<li>MIPI - Up to 2 Camera Sensor Interfaces (24-bit/MIPI)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other Functions</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>RTC - Teal Time Clock</li>\n<li>CPU/Processor - CPU JTAG interface</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>General</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Temperature Range - Standard temperature range: -25°C…+85°C</li>\n<li>Dimensions - 55 x 44 mm</li>\n<li>Plug-in System - Board-to-board plug-in system 320 pins</li>\n<li>Power Supply - 5V</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>OS</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Linux</li>\n<li>VxWorks on request</li>\n<li>QNX on request</li>\n<li>Windows Embedded Compact 2013 on request</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 03:16:37 GMT+0000",
